WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.740
- Heading back to Colorado to go skiing

00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:05.091
and I was able to figure a
way to put a layover in L.A.

00:00:05.091 --> 00:00:07.710
so I can stop and hangout
with Lizz for the day

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:10.093
and hopefully surprise her
at her work at Buzzfeed.

00:00:10.093 --> 00:00:13.590
- I think I got an olympian
to go on a date with me.

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:14.741
His name is Robbie.

00:00:14.741 --> 00:00:17.324
(upbeat music)

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:22.330
- I decided to come down here to L.A.

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:24.400
cause we had such a fun
time in South Korea.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.720
I thought why not keep playing with it,

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:29.610
talking with her and
see how everything goes.

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:31.690
So today's goal is just to have fun,

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:32.860
enjoy each other's company

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:33.990
and then hopefully at the end of the day,

00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:34.840
maybe get a kiss.

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:40.390
Nah, just Robbie.

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:41.540
- Oh, it's just Robbie.

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:44.153
- Okay.

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:48.993
Okay, here we go.

00:00:51.757 --> 00:00:56.430
Hey, hey.
(laughs)

00:00:56.430 --> 00:00:58.000
Hey, I was wondering if it'd be possible

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:01.016
to take Lizz out on our second date today.

00:01:01.016 --> 00:01:02.099
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:03.474 --> 00:01:08.107
- [Robbie] Please!

00:01:08.107 --> 00:01:09.910
- We're just leaving?

00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:12.455
- [Boss] Yeah, I mean go, go, go, go.

00:01:12.455 --> 00:01:13.500
- (laughs) Okay.

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:14.333
Oh my god.

00:01:14.333 --> 00:01:17.048
I'm just, like, I'm just like in shock.

00:01:17.048 --> 00:01:18.598
- Hello!

00:01:18.598 --> 00:01:19.820
- This is Robbie.

00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:21.359
I met him at the Olympics.

00:01:21.359 --> 00:01:24.109
(laughs) I know!

00:01:28.248 --> 00:01:29.560
- This is an amazing love story

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:30.710
and I'm just so here for it.

00:01:30.710 --> 00:01:32.284
- Do you know where you're going?

00:01:32.284 --> 00:01:34.305
- Yeah, we're gonna go that way!

00:01:34.305 --> 00:01:35.770
I thought it'd be super
fun to go surfing today.

00:01:35.770 --> 00:01:37.540
- I went surfing once when I was little

00:01:37.540 --> 00:01:39.910
so I'm definitely not gonna be as good

00:01:39.910 --> 00:01:42.260
as the pro right here
but, you know, we'll see.

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:46.873
- They're super down.

00:01:46.873 --> 00:01:47.920
They're like, whatever, just have fun.

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:48.910
Enjoy yourself.

00:01:48.910 --> 00:01:50.110
It's my life

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:51.410
They're not like, "get married."

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:54.820
Saying, obviously I have
a lot of things I'm trying

00:01:54.820 --> 00:01:56.083
to do right now so it's not...

00:01:56.083 --> 00:01:57.930
It's more just right now, just have fun.

00:01:57.930 --> 00:01:59.610
Enjoy the moment.

00:01:59.610 --> 00:02:00.550
Don't overthink it.

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:02.040
Just, you know, live.

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:03.133
- Robbie and I are headed to the beach.

00:02:03.133 --> 00:02:07.515
We're chatting in the car
and everything's going well.

00:02:07.515 --> 00:02:10.840
He's really easy to talk to

00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:13.200
and is also very smooth.

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:14.990
Not as smooth as me,
but you know. (scoffs)

00:02:14.990 --> 00:02:15.960
- [Robbie] Lizz, check this out.

00:02:15.960 --> 00:02:18.043
(laughs)

00:02:26.274 --> 00:02:27.107
- Ha, ha! I get to see it again!

00:02:27.107 --> 00:02:27.940
- No!

00:02:32.270 --> 00:02:35.660
- I'm so excited to go out
with Lizz on the waves.

00:02:35.660 --> 00:02:36.660
We'll see how it goes.

00:02:36.660 --> 00:02:39.230
- He's ready to get destroyed by me.

00:02:40.827 --> 00:02:43.921
Like, literally the wind blew my board

00:02:43.921 --> 00:02:46.569
off course when I was walking

00:02:46.569 --> 00:02:50.089
so I can only imagine how
this is gonna go in the water.

00:02:50.089 --> 00:02:53.180
(upbeat music)

00:02:53.180 --> 00:02:56.290
Surfing is (bleep) harder than it looks.

00:02:56.290 --> 00:02:57.960
The waves look super tame and super chill

00:02:57.960 --> 00:02:59.978
but actually, when you're out there,

00:02:59.978 --> 00:03:02.540
they're (bleep) intense.

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:03.789
- Yeah!

00:03:03.789 --> 00:03:06.230
(laughs)

00:03:06.230 --> 00:03:07.820
I'm exhausted, super fun though.

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:10.350
I'm pumped that Lizz is out here

00:03:10.350 --> 00:03:11.950
getting up on some of the waves.

00:03:13.167 --> 00:03:15.490
(grunts) The training.

00:03:15.490 --> 00:03:17.760
- Just got done surfing with Robbie.

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:18.593
- While we're out there, we were able

00:03:18.593 --> 00:03:20.860
to get a little bit of time together

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:23.080
but not enough to squeeze a kiss in

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:24.260
so that was kinda a bummer.

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:26.730
I'm hoping for the next
section of this date

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:29.540
that maybe I could find the
time to squeeze a kiss in.

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:31.725
- So what's next for you?

00:03:31.725 --> 00:03:33.768
Are you waiting to hear back
from places or something?

00:03:33.768 --> 00:03:36.680
- Yeah, either a company in Florida

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:38.830
or a company in Washington D.C.

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:41.644
Mom, I mean Lizz, chill
out on the job stuff, okay?

00:03:41.644 --> 00:03:44.550
I have tons of time to go live my life,

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:45.940
get a job and grow up, okay?

00:03:45.940 --> 00:03:47.620
- Well, this was such an amazing date

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:50.433
and I really hope that I
get to see again one day.

00:03:50.433 --> 00:03:51.810
- I hope so too.

00:03:51.810 --> 00:03:53.970
This is super fun and
let's just stay in contact

00:03:53.970 --> 00:03:55.820
and see where it goes.

00:03:55.820 --> 00:03:56.773
- Okay.
- Yeah?

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:03.700
- I'll see you later.

00:04:05.075 --> 00:04:05.908
- [Lizz] Thank you so much

00:04:05.908 --> 00:04:06.741
- [Robbie] See you soon.

00:04:06.741 --> 00:04:08.574
- [Lizz] See you soon.

00:04:10.077 --> 00:04:14.691
You know I'm not totally
sure of Robbie's intentions.

00:04:14.691 --> 00:04:18.740
It seems like he just wants
to have fun and live life

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:22.350
where as I am very focused on my career

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:24.970
and I live in L.A. and I'm
not going all over the place

00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:26.850
as much as he is and figuring out

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:28.090
where I'm gonna be living.

00:04:28.090 --> 00:04:29.280
So, you know, we're at these two

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:31.133
very different stages of our life.

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:33.978
I really like spending time with him.

00:04:33.978 --> 00:04:36.561
I just really don't know
what's going to happen next.

00:04:36.561 --> 00:04:39.144
(smooth music)

